---
---
<section class="comparison-section shell reveal" id="comparison">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-eyebrow" data-i18n="comparison.eyebrow">效率对比看板</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="comparison.title">为什么 KeyLaunch 比传统方式快 3 倍？</h2>
    <p class="section-lede" data-i18n="comparison.lede">
      应用切换不应产生任何思维中断。对比 KeyLaunch 与常见切换方式在直达终端或常用编辑器时的步骤与耗时：
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
    <!-- KeyLaunch (Winner) -->
    <div class="comp-card comp-keylaunch">
      <div class="comp-header">
        <span class="comp-badge">极速首选</span>
        <span class="comp-time" data-i18n="comp.keylaunch.time">0.1秒 · 1步直达</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="comp-name" data-i18n="comp.keylaunch.title">KeyLaunch 键启</h3>
      <div class="comp-steps">
        <div class="step-item step-highlight">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <span class="step-text" data-i18n="comp.keylaunch.desc">纯肌肉记忆触发。按下 ⌥+G 瞬间拉起终端，无需打字，无需肉眼寻找，不打断工作心流。</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="comp-desc">
        单键物理映射直达目标；再次按下自动隐藏或切回上一应用。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cmd + Tab -->
    <div class="comp-card">
      <div class="comp-header">
        <span class="comp-badge comp-badge-neutral">多步轮询</span>
        <span class="comp-time" data-i18n="comp.cmdtab.time">1.2秒 · N步切换</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="comp-name" data-i18n="comp.cmdtab.title">Cmd + Tab 轮询</h3>
      <div class="comp-steps">
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <span class="step-text">按下 ⌘ + Tab 呼出列表</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <span class="step-text">多次敲击 Tab 逐个轮询</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <span class="step-text">肉眼定位图标并松开按键</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="comp-desc" data-i18n="comp.cmdtab.desc">
        多次敲击 Tab 并在水平图标条中肉眼搜寻目标，应用开多了极易按过头，效率低下。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Spotlight / Raycast -->
    <div class="comp-card">
      <div class="comp-header">
        <span class="comp-badge comp-badge-neutral">打字搜索</span>
        <span class="comp-time" data-i18n="comp.spotlight.time">0.8秒 · 3步操作</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="comp-name" data-i18n="comp.spotlight.title">Spotlight / Raycast</h3>
      <div class="comp-steps">
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <span class="step-text">⌘ + 空格 呼出搜索框</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <span class="step-text">键盘输入 2~3 个字母 "ter"</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <span class="step-text">敲击回车 ↵ 启动</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="comp-desc" data-i18n="comp.spotlight.desc">
        必须先呼出搜索框，输入 2~3 个字母再按回车。每次切换都强行中断当前打字与思考。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dock -->
    <div class="comp-card">
      <div class="comp-header">
        <span class="comp-badge comp-badge-neutral">鼠标点击</span>
        <span class="comp-time" data-i18n="comp.dock.time">2.0秒 · 4步操作</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="comp-name" data-i18n="comp.dock.title">Dock 栏鼠标点击</h3>
      <div class="comp-steps">
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <span class="step-text">右手离开键盘移向鼠标</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <span class="step-text">移到屏幕边缘等待 Dock 浮现</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <span class="step-text">肉眼搜寻图标并点击</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="comp-desc" data-i18n="comp.dock.desc">
        右手离开键盘移向鼠标，移到屏幕边缘等待 Dock 浮现，肉眼搜寻图标并点击，最费心费力。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
